  id: spell-magic-missile
  displayName: Magic Missile
  description: You create three glowing darts of magical force. Each dart hits a creature of your choice that you can see within range, dealing 1d4 + 1 force damage. The darts all strike simultaneously and the attack automatically hits. Modeled here as up to 3 targets, each taking one guaranteed 1d4+1 hit -- stacking multiple darts onto a single target isn't modeled (no per-effect repeat/stack mechanism yet), so a focused single-target cast undercounts the real 3d4+3 total.
